extends ./layout/layout-default
block content
  article.TextPage
    p.Eyebrow ABOUT THE GAME
    h1 A small game about big decisions.
    p In Hire and Seek, you run the hiring desk at Orbit Works. Scout learns from past hiring choices. You watch what happens and ask what it learned.
    p The orange applicants are from Bengaluru. The blue applicants are from Chennai. City and colour are not measures of skill.
    h2 What will you do?
    p Hire people, train Scout, investigate a decision, and test a repair on 200 fresh CVs. Your place saves on this browser. At the end you can download a receipt with the actual results.
    p
      a(href='./resources.html#objectives') Read the learning objectives
